{"title":"1963 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problem 24","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>When <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is subtracted from a certain number, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/6/35672a19103f2ead1f02935bb8450addc3318b94.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"19\" height=\"16\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/2/d129a7b3c0bf9fbd0693afdd426a66d2a0a8c3ae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"11\" height=\"37\" /> of the number remains. The equation which expresses this relationship is:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/b/b5b5b2479440cb9618ffd2562970e2d64f4bbfe6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)} \\quad N-5=\\frac{1}{5} \\quad \\quad \\text{(B)} \\quad \\frac{1}{5}N-5=0 \\quad \\text{(C)} \\quad 5N+25=N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"461\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/7/2475a22323006056e27d8b63228a4acb1ba0a0a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(D)} \\quad N-5=\\frac{1}{5}N \\quad \\text{(E)} \\quad 5N-25=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"300\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The left side of the equation is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/e/85e709e111926d2fed921c3e62e1751ab3b307e5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N-5$\" width=\"47\" height=\"12\" />. \"When 5 is subtracted from a certain number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" />...\"\n</p><p>The right side of the equation is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/4/ad481f5ab5b9d0854670f44b5b92787742df7a46.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{5}N.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"36\" height=\"38\" /> \"1/5 of the number remains.\"\n</p><p>Put them together to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/6/b96cc0ecf41b1b7090931178a53e6729998ed092.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\text{(D)} \\quad N-5=\\frac{1}{5}N}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"159\" height=\"48\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Mathematics_Contests\" title=\"1963 TMTA High School Mathematics Contests\">1963 TMTA High School Mathematics Contests</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems\" title=\"1963 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems\">Problems</a>)</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"30%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problem_23\" title=\"1963 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problem 23\"> Problem 23</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"40%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=TMTA_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_Past_Problems/Solutions\" title=\"TMTA High School Mathematics Contest Past Problems/Solutions\">TMTA High School Mathematics Contest Past Problems/Solutions</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"30%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problem_25\" title=\"1963 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problem 25\">Problem 25</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018041558\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.016 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.036 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 74/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 661/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 305/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1756/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    7.016      1 Template:Succession_box\n100.00%    7.016      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:20668:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018041558 and revision id 144624. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}